{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19283","headline":"乐天少傅五月长斋广延缁徒谢绝文友坐成睽间因以戏之 · 刘禹锡","name":"乐天少傅五月长斋广延缁徒谢绝文友坐成睽间因以戏之","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"五月长斋戒，深居绝送迎。\n不离通德里，便是法王城。\n举目皆僧事，全家少俗情。\n精修无上道，结念未来生。\n宾合缁衣占，书堂信鼓鸣。\n戏童爲塔象，啼鸟学经声。\n黍用青菰角，葵承玉露烹。\n马家供薏苡，刘氏饷芜菁。\n暗网笼歌扇，流尘晦酒铛。\n不知何次道，作佛几时成。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19283.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19283","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}